  "html": "<article id=\"post-5616\" class=\"container post-5616 page type-page status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry\">\n\n\t<div class=\"entry-content | container\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-4d640bad wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)\">\n<section class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-3397b2f9 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-container-core-column-is-layout-a870098f wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-bottom:0\">\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-secondary-color has-text-color has-link-color has-x-large-font-size wp-elements-1\">Schedule Your $59 System Check-Up!</h1>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a5675e6c wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-left:0\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">There’s nothing worse than a home without heat during the freezing winter months!</p>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Don’t let the cold catch you off guard this winter. If it’s been six months or more since your last HVAC check-up, your system could be at serious risk of failure when temperatures drop.</p>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Call or book online today to schedule your winter HVAC tune-up and ensure your home stays warm all season long!</p>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group full-width-mobile has-global-padding is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-f9c36406 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group full-width-mobile is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-46e6df75 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-right:0;padding-left:0\">\n<p class=\"horizon-text has-secondary-font-family wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">Speak with an expert</p>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+18643626329\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"icon\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span>(864) 362-6329</span>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"text-center has-primary-color has-text-color has-link-color has-secondary-font-family has-small-font-size wp-elements-2 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><strong>Same day appointments available by phone</strong></p>\n\n<a href=\"https://happyhomeheatingandcooling.com/maintenance/\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-tools\" /></svg><span >Learn About Our Maintenance Plans</span>\n\n</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<style>.wp-block-firebox-paragraph.block-5468_d1b5f1-8f > p { font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:0px; }</style><div id=\"block-5468_d1b5f1-8f\" class=\"wp-block-firebox-paragraph block-5468_d1b5f1-8f wp-block-firebox\"><p class=\"\"><strong><strong><strong>Indoor Unit Services</strong>:</strong></strong></p></div>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Check thermostat</li>\n\n<li>Confirm system operation</li>\n\n<li>Inspect air filter</li>\n\n<li>Inspect cabinet and exterior</li>\n\n<li>Inspect coil &amp; pan &amp; condensate drain</li>\n\n<li>Check capacitor and all wiring/connections</li>\n\n<li>Visual inspection of circuit boards</li>\n\n<li>Check power switch or service disconnect</li>\n\n<li>Check for proper voltage supply</li>\n\n<li>Check all safeties are functioning</li>\n\n<li>Check motor amps</li>\n\n<li>Check for CO and smoke detection and safety</li>\n\n<li>Visual inspection of all duct connections</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<style>.wp-block-firebox-paragraph.block-5468_555dbc-76 > p { font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:0px; padding: 0px; }</style><div id=\"block-5468_555dbc-76\" class=\"wp-block-firebox-paragraph block-5468_555dbc-76 wp-block-firebox\"><p class=\"\"><strong><strong>Outdoor Unit Services:</strong></strong></p></div>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Confirm operation</li>\n\n<li>Inspect inside cabinet and coil</li>\n\n<li>Visually inspect fan blades and motor</li>\n\n<li>Tighten and check all wiring and connections</li>\n\n<li>Inspect and test capacitor</li>\n\n<li>Inspect hard start or start assist</li>\n\n<li>Check compressor and condenser fan amps and ratings</li>\n\n<li>Verify all safeties are connected</li>\n\n<li>Inspect refrigerant lines, valves and ensure they&#8217;re capped properly</li>\n\n<li>Review age, condition, efficiency, and expected problems, concerns</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\">System check-up price is per system. Residential HVAC systems only. Offer can be used one-time per customer and cannot be combined with other offers. Price valid during regular business hours only. Offer ends March 20, 2025.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-container-core-column-is-layout-4b491eed wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-right:0;padding-left:0\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg has-global-padding is-content-justification-center is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-77e60d7f wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://happyhomeheatingandcooling.com/services/cooling/\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/images/ext/happyhomeheatingandcooling.com/2024/09/NU-HappyHome_Stock-26-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"Happy Home tech preparing an air conditioning unit for the winter in Durham NC\" class=\"wp-image-5478\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover\"/></a></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n\t</div>\n\t</article><!-- #post-5616 -->"
